              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Head-Dependent Relations"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contrast with phrase structure; useful for computational parsing."
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "assets/linguistics/session-6-dependency.png",
