              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Lexical and Compositional Semantics"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Sense vs. reference, entailment, and truth conditions."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Session 8: Pragmatics",
